  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4603.03 Bills",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-06-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4603.03 Bills.\n\n(a) Bills submitted for services rendered shall contain the following:\n\n(1) The name and address of the carrier;\n\n(2) The name and address of the shipper;\n\n(3) The date or dates the service was performed;\n\n(4) The points between which the service was rendered; and\n\n(5) Each item for which a rate is applied, as well as the corresponding rate applied.\n\nSource. #5852, eff 6-23-94; ss by #7240, eff 6-23-00, EXPIRED: 6-23-08\n\nNew. #9379, eff 1-30-09; ss by #12358, eff 8-2-17; ss by #13828, eff 12-22-23 (formerly Saf-C 4603.05) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 4600)",
